  ARRAY['Government‑issued photo ID', 'Proof of relationship (marriage certificate or birth certificate)', 'Payment for certificate fees (varies by state; usually $10–25 each)'],
  'Almost every other administrative task—insurance claims, Social Security, bank account changes—requires a certified copy. Ordering enough at once prevents costly delays.',
  'Funeral directors can usually submit the request on your behalf; ask them first. Order a few extras—replacing them later can take weeks.',
  'Funeral home director or county vital‑records office clerk',
  'Search ''[Your County] vital records office'' online or ask the funeral director for direct numbers and forms.',
  'A short form, payment, and a 1‑3 business‑day processing period. Some counties let you pay online and ship by overnight mail.',
