  'You receive 10‑15 sealed, certified copies ready to distribute to institutions.',
  'Order 10–15 certified copies up front.',
  'Signed authorization letter plus your ID copy if a friend or professional files the request for you.',
  ARRAY['CDC Vital Records Office Finder'],
  ARRAY['death-certificate-request-template.pdf'],
  'Store originals in a fireproof envelope; send only certified copies by mail—never the original.',
