  1,
  'Email advisor to schedule a comprehensive estate review meeting',
  'action'::step_type,
  '{"contactMethod":"email","emailTemplate":"Subject: Urgent - Estate Review Meeting Needed for [DECEASED NAME]\\n\\nDear [ADVISOR NAME],\\n\\n[DECEASED NAME] passed away on [DATE] and I need to schedule a meeting to review and retitle all inherited accounts and assets.\\n\\nI need help with:\\n- Retitling inherited investment accounts\\n- Updating cost basis for all assets\\n- Reviewing and adjusting withdrawal/income strategies\\n- Understanding tax implications of inherited assets\\n\\nI have the following documents ready:\\n- Date-of-death account statements\\n- Real estate appraisals\\n- Death certificate\\n- Letters testamentary/trust documents\\n\\nWhat is your earliest availability for a comprehensive review? I prefer to meet in person if possible.\\n\\nThank you,\\n[YOUR NAME]\\n[PHONE NUMBER]","documentsNeeded":["Date-of-death statements","Real estate appraisals","Death certificate","Executor/trustee documentation"]}'::jsonb,
